            <description><![CDATA[Collect 15 trophies in a row, without stumbling.]]></description> <!-- The description of the achievement for in-game display. -->
            <dataType>Number</dataType> <!-- The type of data  that will be sent with this achievement. Can be either Number or String.  -->
